// An Operation is one leg of a Transfer, and this is where the intent of a
// credit/debit is recorded in the event log before the actual TigerBeetle
// transfer is submitted.
//
// A DEBIT Operation maps 1:1 onto a single TigerBeetle Transfer: debit_account
